# =============================================================================
# RBB PRODUCT CATALOGUE - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# =============================================================================

# Supabase Public Integration (Client-Safe)
# Configured in Vercel / local .env:
# 1. VITE_SUPABASE_URL: Your Supabase Project URL (e.g. https://xyz.supabase.co)
# 2. VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: Safe, public anonymous key for client requests
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://your-project-ref.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="your-anon-public-key"

# Note on Security & Access Control:
# - Catalogue data is publicly browsable without requiring visitor login.
# - Administrative operations (adding, updating, deleting products) require
#   logging in with the designated owner account via Supabase Auth.
# - Privilege checks are enforced server-side by PostgreSQL Row-Level Security (RLS).
# - Passwords, secret keys (service_role), and owner authorization emails are NEVER
#   exposed in frontend environment variables or client-side bundles.
